    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to Apartment 7, Turnstone, a stylish and well-maintained development located just off the Stillorgan Road. This spacious one-bedroom apartment with balcony extends to approximately 57 sq. metres and comes to the market in excellent condition.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright and welcoming throughout and offers well-proportioned living space. The apartment comprises an entrance hall, a generous open-plan living and dining area, a fully fitted kitchen, one spacious double bedroom and a main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from one designated car parking space, providing an added convenience for residents.\r\n\r\nThe location is superb, being within easy reach of Stillorgan and Blackrock Villages, while UCD is also nearby. There are excellent public transport links close by, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\r\n\r\nA host of amenities are available within easy reach, including shopping centres, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and local services.\r\n\r\nApartment 7, Turnstone represents an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer, owner-occupier or investor seeking a well-located one-bedroom apartment in a popular residential development."
      },
